                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "100%'ing this game kind of sucked, and this game is pretty terrible difficulty wise with unfair enemies and bosses. Every fight you have to get onto a table or something so you can deal with the enemies because they are complete bullet sponges. \r\n\r\nEnemy designs, location designs are the only real good part about the game. The guns are fun too, but because of the enemies being bullet sponges it ruins it. Also, this is one of those games where you can only beat it with a guide because the puzzles are stupid. Every cutscene is unskippable so if you die (and you will) you'll have to hear the same stuff all over again",
